Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Description: Guesthouse: kernel driver for the Mac's graphics device (DKMS)
 The driver pvg for Apple's ParavirtualizedGraphics device, as the Mac app
 gives it to a Linux guest: display, buffers and the command rings our Vulkan
 driver uses. DKMS builds it for each installed kernel.
